Z||000002||Kelvin Vivian||04-07-2001||12:23 AM||||A while ago:<P>Was in my 88 GT, next to me, a Camaro Z28...<BR>Light turns green and I punch it, Camaro won.<P>By the time I cruised home, I had an intermittent ticking coming from the rear... Had no idea what it was, a guy at Pep Boys listened and figured it was a loose manifold. Went to GoodYear and once the car was lifted up, they saw that I had a broken engine mount... Since the mount was replaced, I no longer have the ticking from the rear...||||reg||1
